Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:04.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 Pulumi 程序说的是应该存在什么，而不是要做什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each Pulumi program says what should exist, not what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:08.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 里的一条防火墙规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One firewall rule from this repository:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个构造函数，compute.Firewall\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a constructor, compute.Firewall;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:17.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个逻辑名，allow-http；还有参数：port 80，来源不限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a logical name, allow-http; and arguments: port 80, from anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:19.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,作用于带 http-server 标记的 VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for VMs tagged http-server.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上那个 bucket 的例子也是同样的形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's bucket example has the same shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:28.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行这一行什么都不会创建：构造函数只是注册这个资源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Running this line creates nothing: the constructor only registers the resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:34.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是课上讲 Pulumi 的那张图：命令行工具运行你的程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is the lecture's picture of Pulumi: the command line tool runs your program,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:37.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,程序产出期望状态，也就是一棵资源树\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which produces the desired state, a tree of resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:41.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 还会加载它的 state，也就是它上次创建了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pulumi also loads its state, what it created last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:42.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放在你的 bucket 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:46.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,--refresh 参数会先拿这个 state 和实际存在的东西核对一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The --refresh flag first checks that state against what really exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:53.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它比较期望状态和当前状态，每一处差异都变成计划里的一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it compares desired with current, and each difference becomes a plan line:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:57.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加号表示创建，波浪号表示更新，减号表示删除，加减号表示替换\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}+ to create, ~ to update, - to delete, +- to replace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:59.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后它调用 provider\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Finally it calls the providers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:04.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是 Google Cloud、Docker 等等的插件，由它们去调 API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plugins for Google Cloud, Docker and more, which make the API calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:09.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上的横幅：Pulumi 通过云 API 管理基础设施\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner on the slide: Pulumi manages infrastructure through cloud APIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:11.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上列了七个命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture lists seven commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:16.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程用了五个：stack、config、preview、up 和 destroy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial uses five: stack, config, preview, up and destroy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,refresh 只作为参数出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with refresh only as a flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:23.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 new 是灰色的，因为两个项目都已经存在了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The command new stays gray, because both projects already exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:25.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 README 的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the README's command:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:28.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:30.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 up 先预览，再询问，然后执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Up previews, asks, then applies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 --stack dev 选定环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stack dev picks the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:35.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 --refresh 先让 state 和实际情况同步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Refresh syncs the state with reality first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:40.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,-y 替你回答这个问题：do you want to perform this update\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-y answers yes to the question, do you want to perform this update,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:42.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也跳过了你检查计划的机会\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and skips your chance to check the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:45.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步会告诉你这什么时候要紧\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 shows when that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:47.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 preview 在任何改动之前就停下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Preview stops before anything changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你又跑了一次 pulumi up，什么都没改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You run pulumi up again and changed nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:53.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,计划应该显示什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What should the plan show?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:03.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不用做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:08.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,期望状态等于 state，也等于实际情况，所以没有差异\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Desired equals state equals reality, so there is no difference,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不会创建、修改或删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and nothing is created, changed or deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:15.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先记住这一点：这个 repo 里有一个 stack 会打破这条规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Hold that thought: one stack in this repository breaks the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:19.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把自动化部署分成六步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture splits the automated deployment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:24.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,设置、image、VM、provisioning、container 和 Web 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}into six steps: setup, images, VM, provisioning, containers and web server.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:28.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一步对应一个文件；我们从第 1 步开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each maps to a file; we start with step 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:32.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先，启用四个 API：Compute Engine、Service Usage\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, enable four APIs: Compute Engine, Service Usage,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:36.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Cloud Resource Manager 和 Artifact Registry\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Cloud Resource Manager and Artifact Registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:40.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,应用的聊天还需要前几讲用过的 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The app's chat also needs Vertex AI, from earlier lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:42.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后创建两个服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then create two service accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,deployment 拿到六个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deployment gets six roles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:47.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中有 Compute Admin、Compute OS Login\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}among them Compute Admin, Compute OS Login,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:51.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Artifact Registry Administrator 和 Storage Admin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Artifact Registry Administrator and Storage Admin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:55.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建一个 JSON 密钥，改名为 deployment.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create a JSON key, and rename it deployment.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:59.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个是 gcp-service，拿到三个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second, gcp-service, gets three roles:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:03.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Storage Object Viewer、Vertex AI Administrator\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Storage Object Viewer, Vertex AI Administrator
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和 Artifact Registry Reader\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Artifact Registry Reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:08.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的密钥改名为 gcp-service.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its key becomes gcp-service.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要两个？deployment 负责建东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why two? Deployment builds things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:15.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它需要在你们组的项目上有管理员权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It needs admin rights on your group's project,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:18.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是 README 的默认项目，才能创建 VM 并登录进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the README's default, to create the VM and log in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,窄权限的账号只负责运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The narrow account only runs things:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:25.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它读取 image 和存储的文件，并使用 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it reads images and stored files and uses Vertex AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:28.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个密钥都放进 clone 旁边的 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both keys go into a secrets folder next to your clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是 clone 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:36.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一步的部署脚本从 src/deployment 往上找三层目录，来找到它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The deployment script of the next step looks three folders up from src/deployment to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把你的密钥放好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and place your keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:44.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 漏了一步：没有任何东西创建 Artifact Registry 仓库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One step is missing from the README: nothing creates the Artifact Registry repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:48.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们在下一步用一行额外的 gcloud 命令创建它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We create it with one extra gcloud line in the next step,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:51.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等部署 container 跑起来以后\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}once the deployment container runs;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跳过这一步，push 就会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}skip it, and the push fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:57.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 没让你们每人各装一套不同的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rather than each of you installing different tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:01.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而是把它们打包进一个 container，也就是部署工具箱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README packs them into one container, the deployment toolbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:06.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 docker-shell.sh 里，第 9 到 17 行设置它的环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 9 to 17 of docker-shell.sh set its environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:10.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 34 到 43 行把它接到你的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 34 to 43 wire it to your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:14.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们挂载 Docker socket，让它用你的 Docker 来构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They mount the Docker socket, so it builds on your Docker,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把 deployment 挂成 /app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then deployment as /app,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:19.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再挂上 secrets、一份 Docker 配置和三个服务目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the secrets, a Docker config and the three service folders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进到 src/deployment\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change into src/deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 docker-shell.sh 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In docker-shell.sh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:27.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 GCP project 变量设成你的项目 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}set GCP_PROJECT to your project ID;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的是一个占位符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ours is a placeholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在按 repo 里的原样运行 docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now run docker-shell.sh, as committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:36.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下载返回 404 Not Found，构建停下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Downloads answer 404 Not Found, the build stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:41.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本却照样运行 container：pull access denied\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the script runs the container anyway: pull access denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:45.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因在第 4 行：基础 image 是 Debian 11，也就是 bullseye\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cause is line 4: the base image is Debian 11, bullseye,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:48.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的安全更新已经挪到了归档里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}whose security updates moved to an archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复 1：把 bullseye 改成 bookworm，也就是 Debian 12\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fix 1: change bullseye to bookworm, Debian 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:56.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次。这次停在第 29 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run it again. Now it stops at line 29:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:05:00.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:04.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 给它改了名，apt 甚至直接说出了替代品\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google renamed it, and apt even names the replacement,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:06.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,google-cloud-cli\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}google-cloud-cli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复 2：把两个包都改名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fix 2: rename both packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:12.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是两处修复的真实 diff，各改一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is the real diff of the two fixes, one line each.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把两处都改好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and make both edits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:19.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三次运行大约 92 秒就构建好了，entrypoint 开始运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The third run builds in about 92 seconds, and the entrypoint starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:23.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个报错：Invalid grant: account not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First error: invalid_grant: Invalid grant: account not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:27.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的密钥不属于任何账号；你的会激活 deployment 账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our key belongs to no account; yours activates the deployment account.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:30.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目和 registry 辅助工具都通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The project and registry helper pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:35.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 state bucket：我们的没能创建，Pulumi 也没能登录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the state bucket: ours could not be created, and Pulumi could not log in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:40.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会在第一次运行时创建这个 bucket，登录，然后停在这里等你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours creates the bucket the first time, logs in, and leaves you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:44.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查一下工具：gcloud、Pulumi 和 kubectl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check the tools: gcloud, Pulumi and kubectl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:48.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有个意外：kubectl 比 Dockerfile 固定的版本新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One surprise: kubectl is newer than the Dockerfile pins,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:54.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 Google 的 apt 软件源有它自己的 kubectl 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because Google's apt repository has its own kubectl package with a higher version,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:55.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,版本更高，apt 就选了它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and apt picks it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一个检查：gcloud auth list\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last check: gcloud auth list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的显示 No credentialed accounts\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours says No credentialed accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:03.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会把 deployment 账号列为 active\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours lists the deployment account as active;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:06.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果没有，就检查 secrets 里的文件名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if not, check the file name in secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:11.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后用前面说的那行额外命令创建 registry 仓库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then create the registry repository with the extra line from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两个都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:16.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是课件里唯一没讲的一项设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is the one setup the slides skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:21.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 会通过 SSH 登录 VM，去运行脚本、驱动 Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pulumi will log in to the VM over SSH to run scripts and drive Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,谁来登录？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Who logs in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:27.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,deployment 服务账号，通过 OS Login\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The deployment service account, through OS Login:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:31.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,VM 接受登记在这个账号个人资料里的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the VM accepts a key registered to that account's login profile,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:35.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的是 Google 据账号生成的一个 Linux 用户名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}under a Linux username Google derives from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:38.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先，为项目打开 OS Login\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, turn OS Login on for the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照印的原样敲，这个模板会因为 no such file 而失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Typed as printed, the template fails with no such file.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:46.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,又是尖括号那一课：把整个占位符换掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is the angle bracket lesson again: replace the whole placeholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:51.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的例子用的是它自己的项目，你要改成你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README example uses its own project, which you change to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:54.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的显示 no active account；你的会输出 Updated\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours says no active account; yours prints Updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:59.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是密钥：在 /secrets 里运行 ssh-keygen\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, the key: in /secrets, run ssh-keygen with the name
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:04.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名字叫 ssh-key-deployment，按两次回车，再回到 /app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ssh-key-deployment, press Enter twice, and go back to /app.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不设 passphrase：Pulumi 没法替你输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No passphrase: Pulumi cannot type one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:13.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在这两个文件就在你笔记本的 secrets 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The two files now sit in the secrets folder on your laptop: the private key,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,私钥只有你能读，另一半是公钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}readable only by you, and the public half.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把公钥上传到 OS Login 的个人资料里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then upload the public half to the OS Login profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的停在同一个报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours stops at the same error;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:26.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 给出了你的输出，最后是一个以 sa_ 开头的用户名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README shows yours, ending in a username that starts with sa_.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:28.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制下来：VM 那个 stack 的 config 要用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy it: the VM stack's config needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:33.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：下一个小节让你编辑 inventory.yml\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the next heading asks you to edit inventory.yml.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:39.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个文件根本不存在；它属于课程早先用 Ansible 的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No such file exists; it belongs to an earlier, Ansible version of the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 的 config 取代了它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Pulumi config replaces it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:44.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：构建并 push image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: build and push the images.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:48.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你笔记本的箭头落在 registry 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop's arrow lands on the registry;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:52.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件第 21 页还叫它 GCR，这是它退役的旧名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}slide 21 still calls it GCR, its retired name:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:55.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在它叫 Artifact Registry\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}today it is Artifact Registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:59.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 用同一个程序的不同 stack 把环境隔开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pulumi keeps environments apart as stacks of one program,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,dev、staging 和 production\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}dev, staging and production,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个都有自己的 state 和 config\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each with its own state and config.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:07.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程每个项目只有一个 stack，就是 dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial has one stack, dev, per project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:10.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的全名 organization/deploy-images/dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its full name, organization/deploy-images/dev,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:14.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,会被 VM 那个项目用到，所以别改名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is used by the VM project, so do not rename it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 stack 的 state 都放在你的 bucket 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every stack state sits in your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:21.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进到 deploy images，运行 pulumi stack init dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change into deploy_images and run pulumi stack init dev.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有登录 bucket 时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a bucket login,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:26.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 会推荐它自己的云服务，并等着浏览器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pulumi offers its own cloud and waits for a browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:29.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的提示 stack 已经存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If yours says the stack already exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就用 pulumi stack select dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}use pulumi stack select dev.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 config set、preview 和 up 都会打印\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Config set, preview and up all print:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:36.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi access token must be set\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}PULUMI_ACCESS_TOKEN must be set.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:39.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了还是能展示它们，我们用一个本地目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To show them anyway, we use a local folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:42.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pulumi login --local：这是额外步骤，你不用照做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pulumi login --local: extra, and not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:45.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 stack init 返回 Created stack dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stack init answers Created stack 'dev',
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:49.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,config set 把你的项目写进 Pulumi.dev.yaml\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and config set writes your project into Pulumi.dev.yaml.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:55.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 13 行生成一个精确到秒的时间戳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 13 makes a timestamp, down to the second,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:58.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 14、15 行拼出 registry 的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and lines 14 and 15 build the registry address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:02.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 image 是一个 docker build Image 资源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each image is one docker_build.Image resource:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个带时间戳的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a timestamped tag,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:08.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,push 设为 true，retain on delete，还有一个平台，AMD64\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}push true, retain_on_delete, and one platform, AMD64.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Apple 芯片的 Mac 模拟它会很慢\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An Apple silicon Mac emulates that slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:16.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 34、35 行把 tag 导出给另一个项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 34 and 35 export the tag for the other project.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:20.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 preview，只有前端：五个 provider 插件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The extra preview, frontend only: five provider plugins,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:23.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个要创建的 image 和它带时间戳的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one image to create with its timestamped tag,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:26.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一条警告：Skipping preview build\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a warning: Skipping preview build.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次 preview 从来不会构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A preview never builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:32.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 up 才会真的构建：npm install，Next.js 构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Up does build: the npm install, the Next.js build,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:36.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 push，在这里失败了，403 Forbidden\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then the push, which fails here with 403 Forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会把三个 image 都构建出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours builds all three images, slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:41.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,很慢，最后在输出里列出每个 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and ends with each tag in the outputs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:46.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还记得前面那个问题吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember the earlier question?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:48.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 stack 打破了那条规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This stack breaks the rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:52.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次 up 都会重新构建 image，因为时间戳每次都是新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each up rebuilds the images, because the timestamp is new every run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:57.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次运行都可能往 registry 里加 image 层，而存储是要花钱的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each run can add image layers to the registry, and storage costs money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:00.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：创建 VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: create the VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:04.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件在它旁边画了一个网络共享\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slide draws a network share beside it;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:08.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这份代码里，那是第二块磁盘，挂载在 /mnt/disk-1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in this code that is a second disk, mounted at /mnt/disk-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:10.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进到 deploy single VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change into deploy_single_vm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:14.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 stack init、三次 config set、preview 和 up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stack init, three config sets, preview and up:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有登录 bucket，每一个都打印同样的报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}without the bucket login, each prints the same error.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:23.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在本地 backend 上，config 显示项目、你被遮住的用户名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the local backend, the config shows the project, your masked username,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:25.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及 VM 运行时用的账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the account the VM runs as:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:29.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你自己项目里的 deployment，不是 README 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}deployment at your own project, not the README's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:33.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，三个都设好，再用 pulumi config 检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, set all three, and check them with pulumi config.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:37.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,主文件按课上的顺序做四次调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The main file makes four calls, in the lecture's order:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:42.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建实例、provision 实例、设置 container、设置 Web 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}create the instance, provision it, set up the containers, set up the web server.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:45.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 create instance 里，先把围栏建好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create instance builds the fences first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:52.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个云网络，也叫 cheese-app-network，还有三道防火墙门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There is a cloud network, also called cheese-app-network, and three firewall gates:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:56.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给带标记的 VM 开 80 和 443，给所有 VM 开 22\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}80 and 443 for the tagged VMs, 22 for every VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:11:02.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是一块 50 GB 的数据磁盘，以及查找最新的 Ubuntu image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then a 50 GB data disk, and a lookup of the newest Ubuntu image.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:07.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,VM 的地址是一个输出，一个密封的信封，等 VM 存在了才会打开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The VM address is an output, a sealed envelope that opens once the VM exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:12.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正的 preview 计划了一块磁盘、一个网络和三条防火墙规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The real preview plans a disk, a network and three firewalls,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.49,0:11:15.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后停在第 100 行，Invalid grant\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stops at line 100, invalid_grant:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:18.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,image 查找是第一个需要 Google 的调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the image lookup is the first call needing Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:21.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会继续，一共大约三十个资源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours goes on to about thirty resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:23.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 -y 之前先检查计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check the plan before -y:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:28.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,更新的 Ubuntu image 可能让下一次 up 变成替换 VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a newer Ubuntu image can turn the next up into a VM replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:30.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后暂停一下，运行 up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then pause and run up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这里开始就要花钱了，大约每天两美元\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From here it costs roughly two dollars a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另加磁盘和外部 IP 的费用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus disks and an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:39.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步 provisioning 在课件上没有图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, provisioning, has no slide picture:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:42.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它发生在 VM 内部，通过 SSH\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it happens inside the VM, over SSH.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:48.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,九条远程命令串成一条链：格式化并挂载磁盘、更新、安装 Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nine remote commands run in a chain: format and mount the disk, update, install Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:52.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 记得一条命令跑过，但不记得它改了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pulumi remembers that a command ran, not what it changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看第一条：blkid 检查有没有文件系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at the first one: blkid checks for a filesystem,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:12:00.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有没有的时候，mkfs 才格式化磁盘\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and only if there is none, mkfs formats the disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:06.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么先用 blkid 检查，而不是直接格式化磁盘？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why check with blkid first, instead of just formatting the disk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为格式化会清空数据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Because formatting erases.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.31,0:12:21.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果这一步哪天又跑了一次，在 trigger 变了或资源被替换以后\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If this step ever ran again, after a new trigger or a replaced resource,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:26.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直接格式化就会把数据磁盘清空：聊天记录和模型都没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plain formatting would wipe the data disk: the chat history and the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:30.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Pulumi 没法检查的脚本，必须跑两次也安全\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Scripts Pulumi cannot inspect must be safe to run twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: the containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,VM 的程序向 image 的 stack 要它的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The VM program asks the images stack for its tags,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,通过一个 stack reference\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}through a stack reference
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:42.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,指向 organization/deploy-images/dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to organization/deploy-images/dev.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:44.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以先在 deploy images 里运行 up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So run up in deploy_images first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是一个 host 是 SSH 的 Docker provider\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then a Docker provider whose host is SSH,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你的密钥，这样 VM 上的每个 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with your key, so each container on the VM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:55.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都是一个 Pulumi 能比较和替换的资源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is a resource Pulumi can compare and replace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:57.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,出现了三个 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three containers appear:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:03.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前端，8000 上的向量数据库，9000 上的 API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the frontend, the vector database on 8000, the API on 9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:07.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件把前端放在 80；代码里是 3000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slide puts the frontend on 80; the code, on 3000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步：Web 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6: the web server.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:16.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最上面出现了 nginx 的 container，port 80 移到了它身上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The nginx container appears on top, and port 80 moves onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:22.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的配置文件上传时带着一个校验和，作为 trigger\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its config file is uploaded with a checksum as a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:26.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改了 nginx.conf，就只有这几步会重新运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change nginx.conf, and only these steps run again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没有录到成功的 pulumi up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No successful pulumi up was captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:33.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这里是它会建出来的东西，照着代码画的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So here is what it builds, drawn from the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:36.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是六个输出，其中有 instance IP\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It ends on six outputs, among them the instance_ip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:41.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：导出的 SSH 命令漏了密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the exported SSH command leaves out the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:45.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 -i /secrets/ssh-key-deployment\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add -i /secrets/ssh-key-deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:48.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上标出了每把密钥的职责\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture marks the job of each key:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:54.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,deployment 创建 VM 并登录，窄权限的密钥读取 image 和模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}deployment creates the VM and logs in, the narrow key reads images and models.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:55.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行中的应用需要一把密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The running app needs one key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:14:00.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会把哪一把交给 VM，为什么不给另一把？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which would you hand the VM, and why not the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,gcp-service 的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gcp-service key:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:15.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它能读 image 和存储的对象，能用 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it reads images and stored objects and uses Vertex AI;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:18.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它不能创建 VM、磁盘或 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it cannot create VMs, disks or buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:22.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,deployment 能，而一台被攻破的 VM 绝不该拿着它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deployment can, which a compromised VM should never hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个补充说明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two footnotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:29.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 用你的 deployment 凭据 pull image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repository pulls the images with your deployment credentials
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,VM 本身也以 deployment 的身份运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and runs the VM itself as deployment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:35.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只受 scopes 限制，也就是 VM 可以调用哪些服务的清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}capped only by scopes, a list of what the VM may call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:39.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 API 用窄权限的密钥调用 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the API calls Vertex AI with the narrow key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把窄权限的那把换上去，当作练习试试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Try the narrow one as an exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:45.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的最后一步：测试应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's last step: test the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.33,0:14:50.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开你的 instance IP；页脚显示来自 /status 的 API 版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open your instance_ip; the footer shows the API version from /status.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:59.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 VM 上，通过控制台的 SSH 按钮或修好的 SSH 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the VM, through the console's SSH button or the fixed SSH command,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 会检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README checks:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:04.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列出 container，跟踪每个日志，按 Ctrl-C 停止\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}list the containers, follow each log, Ctrl+C to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:08.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的替身把数据库叫作 cheese-app-vector-db\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our stand-in names the database cheese-app-vector-db.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:13.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 exec 进到 api-service 和 nginx 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exec into api-service and into nginx.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:18.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说明一点：聊天需要一个 Vertex AI 仍在提供的 Gemini 模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One note: chat needs a Gemini model Vertex AI still serves;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:23.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 API 的辅助文件里改掉它，然后在两个项目里都运行 up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}change it in the API's helper files, then run up in both projects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:28.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上最后有专门的一页：别忘了删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture ends with a slide of its own: don't forget to delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 deploy single VM 里，运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In deploy_single_vm,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:34.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:38.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的显示登录报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours shows the login error;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:42.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在本地 backend 上，没有东西可删，一秒钟就结束了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the local backend, with nothing to delete, it finishes in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:45.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pulumi destroy 把这张图倒着走一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Destroy plays the graph backwards:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:48.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先是通过 SSH 部署的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the containers over SSH, then the VM,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:50.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 VM、磁盘、防火墙和网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the disk, the firewalls and the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:53.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 deploy single VM 里运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run it in deploy_single_vm;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:56.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 deploy images 里它只会忘掉这些 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in deploy_images it only forgets the images,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们因为 retain on delete 还留在 registry 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which stay in the registry, retain_on_delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:01.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的清理清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your teardown checklist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:06.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一：destroy VM 的 stack，并确认 VM 列表是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: destroy the VM stack, and check the VM list is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:09.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二：用 gcloud 删除 registry 仓库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: delete the registry repository with gcloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三：state bucket，最后删\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three: the state bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等没有任何 stack 还占着东西的时候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}last, once no stack holds anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:17.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四：第 1 部分的 VM，如果它还在运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four: the part 1 VM, if it still runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:20.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五：你的 Docker Hub image，免费，可删可不删\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five: your Docker Hub images, free and optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:24.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第六：课程结束时，两个服务账号的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Six: when the course ends, both service account keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:28.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾就是课上的六步，每一步都有它的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The recap is the lecture's six steps, each with its file:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:30.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker-shell.sh、deploy images\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker-shell.sh, deploy_images,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:33.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,create instance、provision instance\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}create_instance.py, provision_instance.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:36.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,setup containers 和 setup webserver\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}setup_containers.py and setup_webserver.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:40.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上还列了六条原则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture also names six principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:44.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正的编程语言、声明式、带预览的 state：有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Real language, declarative, state with previews: yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:46.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,组件和测试：这里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Components and tests: not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,provider 可以有很多，但这里只用了一个云平台\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Many providers, but one cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一台 VM 就是单点故障\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One VM is a single point of failure.
